, a Mar–May this warm would come less than once a century. El Niño moves the hottest days most: this season they are expected to shift by about 1 °C, against 0.7 °C for the coldest days. Mar–May rainfall shows no clear long-term trend, but El Niño has a strong, well-established effect toward a drier season with fewer rainy days, and this year's shift is larger than a normal year-to-year swing. Humidity shows no clear long-term trend, but El Niño has a strong, well-established effect toward a less humid Mar–May, and this year's shift is larger than a normal year-to-year swing. For Mar–May 2027, a warmer-than-normal season is very likely (more than 95% chance), about 1.2 °C above the 1991–2020 average; a drier-than-normal season is more likely than not (about 60%), and a less humid season than normal is likely (about 80% chance). This outlook is based on the El Niño strength expected for Sep–Nov 2026 and will be updated when it is observed in early December.","variables":{"temperature":{"normal_1991_2020":29.004,"trend_per_decade":0.2042,"trend_p":0.0,"trend_total_since_1951":1.5315,"enso_effect_per_degC":0.3844,"enso_p":0.0,"confidence":"Strong","survives_fdr":true,"fraction_explained":0.5424,"intrinsic_sd":0.3309,"effect_this_season":0.8458,"effect_ratio":2.5557,"size":"Dominant","size_typical_el_nino":"Dominant","once_every_n_years_without_el_nino":">100","expected_anomaly_2027":1.2421,"p_below":0.0,"p_near":0.0026,"p_above":0.9974,"forecast_words":"Very likely (>95%): a warmer-than-normal season","within_record":true,"years_of_warming_equivalent":41.4193,"values":[28.104,28.642,28.555,28.216,27.818,27.715,28.206,28.855,28.474,28.248,28.033,28.068,27.835,28.244,27.513,28.27,27.62,27.748,28.752,28.534,27.478,27.695,28.854,27.762,28.012,27.819,28.235,28.5,28.772,28.742,28.713,28.181,28.789,28.026,28.03,28.316,29.431,28.945,28.076,29.325,28.775,29.195,28.525,28.587,29.041,28.296,28.572,30.0,28.133,28.362,28.852,29.772,29.267,29.19,28.947,28.82,28.787,28.253,28.629,29.